# This repository is public. Anything private, machine-specific, or
# generated stays out of it. When in doubt, add a pattern here first.

# Signing keys and their passwords. Losing the release key blocks updates,
# and publishing it lets anyone sign a fake update. Keep both off GitHub.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pem
*.pepk
keystore.properties
signing.properties

# Secrets and API keys. The app reads the AI key from its own settings,
# so no key file should exist in the project at all.
secrets.properties
secrets.*.properties
local.defaults.properties
google-services.json
.env
.env.*
*.secret
*.key

# Machine-specific paths, such as the Android SDK location under the user
# profile.
local.properties

# Private test data: real recipe links, saved recipe pages, card photos,
# notes, and backup files. Recipe pages are copyrighted, and photos and
# backups can hold personal information.
testdata/private/
*.recipebackup
*.recipebox
/backups/

# Build output. Release APKs go to GitHub Releases, never into Git.
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.apks
*.dex
*.class
output-metadata.json
build/
/app/release/
captures/
.externalNativeBuild/
.cxx/
.kotlin/

# Gradle caches
.gradle/

# IDE files, which can contain absolute paths and user names
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.vscode/
.fleet/
.navigation/

# Logs, heap dumps, and crash reports, which can contain device data
*.log
*.hprof
/logs/

# AI agent instructions and state: read locally, never committed
**/CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md
**/AGENTS.md
**/AGENTS.override.md
**/GEMINI.md
.claude/
.codex/
.cursor/
.gemini/
.cursorrules
.windsurfrules

# OS and editor noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~
